---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog — CHIRP Radio
description: Latest posts from CHIRP Radio DJs and contributors.
permalink: /blog/
---

<h1>Blog</h1>
<p>Latest posts from CHIRP DJs and contributors.</p>

<ul class="articles-list">
{% for article in cms.articles %}
  <li>
    <h3><a href="/blog/{{ article.slug }}/">{{ article.title }}</a></h3>
    <div class="meta">
      {{ article.publishedDate | chicagoDate }}
      {% if article.author and article.author.name %} · by {{ article.author.name }}{% endif %}
      {% if article.category and article.category.name %} · {{ article.category.name }}{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% if article.excerpt %}<div class="excerpt">{{ article.excerpt }}</div>{% endif %}
  </li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
